  "scientific_review": [
    "All 40 original source cases are covered exactly once across two sequential canonical-owner exports: Indian and Pacific South Equatorial Countercurrents, 20 each. This file retains one batch at native resolution under the fixed 2.4 MB bound. March/June/September/December 15, 2022 00Z are individual model snapshots, not annual ranges or seasonal means. No ocean retrieval.",
    "The unchanged original interval_transverse_section_audit_v1 validator first verifies the untagged source schema, geometry, raw-component hashes, signed velocities and original interval diagnosis. An in-memory deep copy adds only source_section_geometry=longitude for the mixed-geometry dispatcher. The entire validated native_velocity_depth_curtain_v2.curtain function is reused unchanged and repeats that original audit. No partition logic, source edits, geometry interpolation or new tracing math. Own cohort operator, definitions, owner/date and exact batches are checked. All original candidate scores, selected core/layer and seed-run boundaries reproduce.",
    "Both members preserve 90-degree eastward frames, original 0.1 m/s primary, complete finite 0-200 m interval selection and 0-200 m qualifying core search. Surface and temperature gates remain null. All original outcomes remain: 26 interior, seven gate-edge and seven without qualifying interval flow. No weaker interior core replacement, surface gate, threshold/gate tuning or no-flow-to-current-absence claim.",
    "Strict four-native-axis-neighbor support without diagonal/missing bridges, interpolation or core reselection. Preserve separate vertical runs, crossings and missing/domain/lateral censors. Indian 93-97E and Pacific 168-172E are partial regional searches, not entire basin currents or a measured family. The Indian reach lies east of the selected 90E atlas handoff and does not extend its route. Atlantic SECC split cores are excluded pending their own operator. Historical presence and threshold/instrument scales do not establish physical bottoms or annual bounds.",
    "No independently validated body/axis/water-mass/physical bottom, annual extrema, whole-route physical depth, width/area/volume or new scalar references. Missing is not zero, seabed or absence; native brackets are not uncertainty. Profile-date counts are not independent observations. Preserve 808 heterogeneous depth references, prior fitted/regional products and 102 eddy size references. Main/runtime/UI unchanged.",
    "Cloud-only sequential one idle CPU: eight original source checks plus 15 new checks and both actual builds. Tests block Dataset/urlopen, verify two bounded batches cover all 40 cases exactly once, unchanged kernel/validator identity, interval/frame/gate rules, all original cores and boundaries, separate no-qualification/edge outcomes, byte-unchanged source views and geometry/time/diagnosis/schema/tag/gate mutation rejection. Local work is static editing/AST, metadata/hashes and exact retention only."
  ],
